WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Team to Team Referrals is a referral network for licensed pros: one verified team per city, in each industry’s network.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Pick your industry to see its network, and which cities are already held.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Each network’s map shows the team that holds every city, and the seats still open.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Members sign in to a home that shows what needs them today.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.000
To send a referral, pick the city: it goes to the verified team that holds it, with the client’s consent.

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Referrals sent to you arrive in your inbox; accept one and the client’s details are yours.

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
The pipeline tracks every referral from first call to closing.

8
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Fees owed and paid, where the industry allows them, are in one place.

9
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Claim your city before someone else in your network does.
